    {
      "title": "The pendulum doesn’t drive it",
      "text": "It only paces it. The weight supplies all the energy; each tooth gives the pendulum at most 0.1 mJ, under 1% of the 13 mJ in its swing, to replace what the air and spring took. Without the weight the swing dies away; without the pendulum the train races.",
